Package: hostnur-agent
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Hostnur <maintainer@hostnur.dev>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates
Homepage: https://github.com/maelzx/hostnur
Description: Hostnur privileged operations agent
 Native privileged agent for the Hostnur control panel. Resolves every action
 from its own UUID-derived registry and manages Linux accounts, systemd units,
 Nginx/PHP-FPM configuration and package installation on a single Ubuntu host.
 Caller-supplied paths or commands are never trusted.
